# Palmtree: these go out on the Shortband, signed with the hull's name. Short, factual, no drama -
# the machine is reporting its own state to whoever is listening, not addressing the sector.
#
# The one exception is stormdrive-meltdown-player: that line is not an announcement. It is sent
# straight to the crew's chat, map-wide, at the instant the core goes, the same way the
# supermatter says "You feel reality distort for a moment...".
stormdrive-announce-overheat = Core temperature critical. Reduce reactivity.
stormdrive-announce-meltdown-averted = Meltdown averted. Inspect the core.
stormdrive-announce-online = Reactor on-line.
stormdrive-announce-meltdown-armed = Control rods failed. Containment loss in {$seconds}.
stormdrive-announce-countdown = {$seconds} seconds remain before containment failure.
stormdrive-announce-countdown-imminent = {$seconds}...
stormdrive-meltdown-player = You feel the deck lurch. Then everything goes quiet.
stormdrive-announce-offline = Reactor off-line.
stormdrive-announce-rods-failed = Primary control rods failed.
stormdrive-announce-rods-worn = Control rods at {$integrity}% integrity.
stormdrive-announce-dump-blocked = Fuel dump aborted: line pressure exceeds pump capacity.
